# Title: RegAsm.EXE Execution Without CommandLine Flags or Files
# ID: 651f87f7-12db-47f9-84c5-f27b081b94b6
# Status: experimental
# Level: low
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2025-06-04
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.009
# Description: Detects the execution of "RegAsm.exe" without a commandline flag or file, which might indicate potential process injection activity.
# Usually "RegAsm.exe" should point to a dedicated DLL file or call the help with the "/?" flag.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*RegAsm OR process.command_line:*RegAsm.exe OR process.command_line:*RegAsm.exe\" OR process.command_line:*RegAsm.exe')) AND ((process.executable:*\\RegAsm.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"RegAsm.exe")))
